    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oliver was dealt a bad hand in life. Being a poor orphan, he worked hard to get his big break - but now, he's stuck working the night shift at a convenience store for minimum wage. What's a vampire to do?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As it turns out, two people are willing to help him: a flirty customer and his way-too-perfect co-worker. They have secrets of their own, however, which makes Oliver wonder. Can he really trust them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two love interest routes with four endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully hand drawn custom artworks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ event CGs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wholesome vampires!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
